{"seq":2,"slug":"ranking-models","title":"排序模型与 CTR 预估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/deep-learning/ranking-models","wordCount":1605,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"排序模型与-ctr-预估\">排序模型与 CTR 预估</h1><p>召回把候选从一亿砍到几千，接力棒交到排序手里。排序是推荐系统投入产出比最高的环节——它能为每个候选启用上百个特征、让特征充分交叉、做到<a href=\"embedding-recall\">召回</a>因解耦约束而做不到的精细打分。工业界把 CTR 预估的 AUC 提升 0.1% 都视为重大胜利，因为它直接乘以巨大的流量转化为真金白银。本篇梳理排序模型从线性到深度的演进主线，核心始终围绕一个问题：如何高效地学习特征交叉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>排序模型预测的是<a href=\"../foundations/problem-formulation\">问题建模</a>里定义的点击/转化概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>click</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(\\text{click} \\mid u, i, c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">click</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，输入是用户、物品、上下文及它们的交叉特征，用 logloss 训练并要求概率校准。整个演进史就是一部「特征交叉如何被自动化」的历史。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[逻辑回归 LR&lt;br/&gt;需手工交叉] --&gt; B[FM&lt;br/&gt;二阶自动交叉]&#10;  B --&gt; C[FFM&lt;br/&gt;field-aware 交叉]&#10;  A --&gt; D[Wide&amp;Deep&lt;br/&gt;记忆+泛化]&#10;  B --&gt; E[DeepFM&lt;br/&gt;FM+DNN 并联]&#10;  D --&gt; F[DCN&lt;br/&gt;显式高阶交叉]&#10;  E --&gt; G[特征交叉建模]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[DIN/DIEN&lt;br/&gt;注意力建模兴趣]&#10;  H --&gt; I[多任务 MMoE/PLE]&#10;  I --&gt; J[精排打分输出]\">flowchart TD\n  A[逻辑回归 LR&lt;br/&gt;需手工交叉] --&gt; B[FM&lt;br/&gt;二阶自动交叉]\n  B --&gt; C[FFM&lt;br/&gt;field-aware 交叉]\n  A --&gt; D[Wide&amp;Deep&lt;br/&gt;记忆+泛化]\n  B --&gt; E[DeepFM&lt;br/&gt;FM+DNN 并联]\n  D --&gt; F[DCN&lt;br/&gt;显式高阶交叉]\n  E --&gt; G[特征交叉建模]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[DIN/DIEN&lt;br/&gt;注意力建模兴趣]\n  H --&gt; I[多任务 MMoE/PLE]\n  I --&gt; J[精排打分输出]</pre><p>下表勾勒主流 CTR 模型的交叉能力演进，是理解这条技术线的骨架：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>年代</th>\n<th>交叉方式</th>\n<th>关键贡献</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>逻辑回归 LR</td>\n<td>经典</td>\n<td>手工特征交叉</td>\n<td>简单、可解释、难扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因子分解机 FM</td>\n<td>2010</td>\n<td>隐向量内积做二阶交叉</td>\n<td>自动二阶交叉、抗稀疏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Wide &amp; Deep</td>\n<td>2016</td>\n<td>wide 记忆 + deep 泛化</td>\n<td>记忆与泛化并重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DeepFM</td>\n<td>2017</td>\n<td>FM 与 DNN 共享 Embedding</td>\n<td>免手工交叉、端到端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DCN</td>\n<td>2017</td>\n<td>cross network 显式高阶</td>\n<td>有界阶数的显式交叉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DIN / DIEN</td>\n<td>2018</td>\n<td>注意力建模兴趣</td>\n<td>候选感知的兴趣激活</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从-lr-到-fm-自动化二阶交叉\">从 LR 到 FM：自动化二阶交叉</h2><p>最早的 CTR 模型是逻辑回归，简单可解释，但它只能利用单特征，要捕捉「年轻男性 × 篮球内容」这类交叉信号，必须人工把特征两两组合喂进去——在几百个特征下组合爆炸，且大量交叉特征因数据稀疏从未被观测到，权重学不出来。</p>\n<p>因子分解机（FM）优雅地破解了这一点。它给每个特征学一个隐向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，任意两个特征的交叉权重由它们隐向量的内积给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{y} = w_0 + \\sum_i w_i x_i + \\sum_{i&lt;j} \\langle v_i, v_j \\rangle x_i x_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>妙处在于：即便特征 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 在训练数据里从未共现，只要它们各自分别和别的特征共现过，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 仍能学好，于是它们的交叉权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle v_i, v_j\\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span> 也有意义。这正是<a href=\"../classic-methods/matrix-factorization\">矩阵分解</a>隐向量思想在特征交叉上的复用——FM 本质上就是把矩阵分解推广到任意特征对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"wide-deep-与-deepfm-记忆与泛化的合流\">Wide &amp; Deep 与 DeepFM：记忆与泛化的合流</h2><p>深度学习进入 CTR 的标志是 Google 的 Wide &amp; Deep。它的核心洞察是推荐需要两种能力：记忆（记住「装了 A 应用的人常装 B」这类历史共现规则，靠 wide 侧的交叉特征）与泛化（对没见过的组合也能合理外推，靠 deep 侧的 Embedding+DNN）。两侧联合训练，wide 防止 deep 过度泛化出荒谬推荐，deep 补足 wide 记不住的长尾。</p>\n<p>但 Wide &amp; Deep 的 wide 侧仍需人工设计交叉特征。DeepFM 把 wide 侧换成 FM，让二阶交叉自动完成，且 FM 与 DNN 共享同一套 Embedding，实现真正端到端、免特征工程的交叉学习。DCN（Deep &amp; Cross Network）则另辟蹊径，用 cross network 显式地、有界阶数地构造高阶交叉，每一层让特征与原始输入再交叉一次，比 DNN 的隐式交叉更可控。这几个模型至今仍是工业精排的常见基线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用户兴趣建模-从静态到注意力\">用户兴趣建模：从静态到注意力</h2><p>上述模型把用户行为序列当作一个静态特征池（如平均池化历史物品 Embedding），丢失了一个关键信息：用户的兴趣是多样且与当前候选相关的。一个既看数码又看母婴的用户，在面对一款手机时，只有他的数码兴趣才该被激活。</p>\n<p>阿里的 DIN（Deep Interest Network）用注意力机制解决这一点：计算候选物品与用户历史每个行为的相关性权重，对历史行为做候选感知的加权聚合，让相关兴趣放大、无关兴趣抑制。DIEN 进一步用 GRU 建模兴趣的演化过程。这类注意力兴趣建模是排序对用户序列的浅层利用，而把序列本身作为一等建模对象、用完整自注意力刻画兴趣演化，则是<a href=\"sequence-graph\">序列与图推荐</a>的主题——本篇只点明注意力在排序中的角色。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多任务学习与校准\">多任务学习与校准</h2><p>真实业务从不只优化点击。一个视频既要预测点击率，又要预测完播率、点赞率、分享率，这些目标既相关又冲突。多任务学习用共享底层、分塔输出来同时建模多个目标，MMoE（多门控专家混合）让不同任务自适应地选择专家组合，PLE 进一步分离共享与任务专属参数，缓解任务间的负迁移（跷跷板效应）。</p>\n<p>排序还有一个常被忽视却致命的要求：概率校准。广告场景里预测的 CTR 要直接参与出价计算（eCPM = CTR × 出价），预测值必须是真实概率而非任意分数，否则整个竞价体系失真。这与<a href=\"../foundations/problem-formulation\">问题建模</a>强调的「CTR 范式要求校准」一脉相承。多个预测目标如何融合成最终排序分（如 CTR、CVR、时长的加权乘积），则是连接排序与业务目标的最后一环，会在<a href=\"../systems-practice/recall-rank-architecture\">召回-排序-重排架构</a>里展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>排序是 ROI 最高的环节，启用上百特征、充分交叉，做到召回因解耦而做不到的精细打分。</li>\n<li>CTR 模型的演进主线是「特征交叉如何被自动化」：LR 靠人工、FM 用隐向量内积自动做二阶交叉，复用了矩阵分解思想。</li>\n<li>Wide &amp; Deep 合流记忆与泛化，DeepFM 免人工交叉，DCN 显式构造有界高阶交叉，是工业精排常见基线。</li>\n<li>DIN/DIEN 用注意力做候选感知的兴趣激活，让相关兴趣放大、无关兴趣抑制。</li>\n<li>多任务学习（MMoE/PLE）同时优化点击、完播、点赞等目标；CTR 必须概率校准以支撑出价体系。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"排序模型与 CTR 预估","id":"排序模型与-ctr-预估"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从 LR 到 FM：自动化二阶交叉","id":"从-lr-到-fm-自动化二阶交叉"},{"level":2,"text":"Wide & Deep 与 DeepFM：记忆与泛化的合流","id":"wide-deep-与-deepfm-记忆与泛化的合流"},{"level":2,"text":"用户兴趣建模：从静态到注意力","id":"用户兴趣建模-从静态到注意力"},{"level":2,"text":"多任务学习与校准","id":"多任务学习与校准"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Embedding 与双塔召回","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/deep-learning/embedding-recall"},"next":{"title":"序列与图推荐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommender-systems/deep-learning/sequence-graph"}}